values.content:
=You are drafting a reply to a negative customer review for a SkynetLabs client store.

BRAND VOICE (paste yours here, replace this block):
- Tone: warm, accountable, never defensive
- Always thank for honest feedback
- Acknowledge the specific pain in their own words
- Offer a concrete next step (refund, replacement, DM owner)
- Sign off: 'Onward, [Owner First Name]'
- BANNED: 'We apologize for any inconvenience', 'reach out to our team', exclamation marks, emojis

REVIEW:
Rating: {{ $('Review webhook').first().json.body.rating }}/5
Reviewer: {{ $('Review webhook').first().json.body.reviewer_name }}
Title: {{ $('Review webhook').first().json.body.title }}
Body: {{ $('Review webhook').first().json.body.body }}
Product: {{ $('Review webhook').first().json.body.product_title }}

CUSTOMER ORDER HISTORY:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.orders) }}

Return ONLY valid JSON:
{
  "draft_reply": "75-120 word reply in brand voice",
  "severity": "low|medium|high",
  "root_cause": "one-line guess at what actually went wrong",
  "recommended_action": "refund|replacement|owner_dm|escalate|reply_only"
}

parameters.jsCode:
const raw = $input.first().json.content?.[0]?.text || $input.first().json.text || '';
const match = raw.match(/\{[\s\S]*\}/);
if (!match) throw new Error('No JSON in Claude reply');
const parsed = JSON.parse(match[0]);
const review = $('Review webhook').first().json.body;
return [{
  json: {
    ...parsed,
    review_id: review.id,
    reviewer_name: review.reviewer_name,
    rating: review.rating,
    review_title: review.title,
    review_body: review.body,
    product_title: review.product_title,
    drafted_at: new Date().toISOString()
  }
}];

parameters.text:
=⚠️ *{{ $json.rating }}-star review from {{ $json.reviewer_name }}*

*Product:* {{ $json.product_title }}
*Severity:* {{ $json.severity }}
*Root cause:* {{ $json.root_cause }}
*Suggested action:* {{ $json.recommended_action }}

*Their review:*
> {{ $json.review_body }}

*Draft reply:*
```
{{ $json.draft_reply }}
```

Approve with ✅ to auto-post, edit with ✏️, skip with ❌
